<h1>monotonically decreasing</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A <a href="function.html"><em>function</em></a> from a <a href="partialorder.html"><em>partially ordered</em></a> <a href="domain.html"><em>domain</em></a> to a partially ordered <a href="range.html"><em>range</em></a> such that x &le; y implies f(x) &ge; f(y).
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="monotonicallyIncreasing.html"><em>monotonically increasing</em></a>, <a href="strictlyDecreasing.html"><em>strictly decreasing</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
After <a href="../terms.html#CLR90">[CLR90, page 32]</a>.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

